#
# An exception raised by an ordinary property load belongs to the member
# being read. Evaluating its receiver or computed key can move the current
# bytecode source position. Record the member position after that evaluation
# and before emitting the load. Keep the original bracket through constant
# folding so spacing and multi-line keys retain their source coordinates.
#
